  "primary": "An explosion at the aim point with a 3.4-block radius (does not hit you):\n• Damage 1.25 ❤ lightning + 1.25 ❤ earth + 2.5 ❤ arcane (lightning ×2 on wet, earth ×2 on frozen)\n• Charge 35: weakness, stuns for 1 s at 65 charge (×2 on wet)\n• Then the lightning jumps onward: up to 4 targets in a row, jumps up to 4 blocks, 1.25 ❤ and 40 charge each (×2 damage and longer jumps on wet, ×1.5 range in puddles)\n• Light push\n• Breaks up to 3 blocks within 0.5 blocks (twice as many if brittle)\n• Arcane instability: −0.5 ❤ every 2 s for 6 s",
